0.01: Consolidated production release. Replaces the previous apps/orbit implementation with the tested Sun-Earth-Moon + integrated 5-week calendar build. Renames all app-owned storage/modules to orbit, moves configuration into the standard Bangle app settings list via orbit.settings.js, removes development timing/tap diagnostics from the display, retains yellow selected-date blinking and outside-grid double-tap clearing, keeps yearly Japan/England-Wales/Scotland/Northern-Ireland holiday bit caches, and adds in-settings creation/edit/delete of anniversaries and exceptional holidays stored in orbit.events.json.
